          }
        },
        "explanation": "$HJ^2 = 13^2 + 9^2 - 2 \\times 13 \\times 9 \\times \\cos 75^\\circ = 250 - 60.56 = 189.44$, so $HJ = 13.8$ km."
      },
      {
        "label": "(c)",
        "type": "NUMERICAL",
        "marks": 2,
        "stem": "Calculate angle $BHJ$, correct to 1 decimal place.",
